---
// v2/src/components/pace/Faq.astro
---
<section id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title" class="bg-white py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] gap-12 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-span-4"><div class="@container w-full"><p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-ink/55"><span class="text-signal-deep">08</span><span class="h-px w-8 bg-ink/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>Questions</p><h2 id="faq-title" data-split="true" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,9cqw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.92] text-ink text-balance"><span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">Good</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">to</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">know.</span></span></h2><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-[17px] text-ink/60 text-pretty">The questions we hear most from athletes considering their first screenless band.</div><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-8"><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 rounded-full min-h-12 px-6 py-2 text-sm leading-snug border border-ink/15 bg-white text-ink hover:border-ink/45" href="#faq">All questions<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div data-reveal="true" class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6"><ul class="border-t border-line"><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_5a6_-button-0" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="_R_5a6_-panel-0" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">Why doesn&#x27;t PACE Band have a screen?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo rotate-45 border-ink bg-ink text-white group-hover:border-ink"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_5a6_-panel-0" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_5a6_-button-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[1fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Because the most useful data is the data you don&#x27;t stare at. Without a display, the band is thinner, lighter, lasts up to 10 days and never pulls your attention mid-session. Live numbers stream to your phone when you want them, and silent haptic cues tell you when you drift out of your target zone.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_5a6_-button-1" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_5a6_-panel-1" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">Is there a subscription?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_5a6_-panel-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_5a6_-button-1" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">No. Every metric, every insight, your complete history and full data export are included with the band. Software updates that add new features are free for the life of the product.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_5a6_-button-2" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_5a6_-panel-2" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">How do I start a workout without a screen?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_5a6_-panel-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_5a6_-button-2" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Double-tap the core and a short haptic pulse confirms the session has started. Runs, rides, swims, walks and strength sessions are also detected automatically, and you can start any of 90 activity types from the app.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_5a6_-button-3" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_5a6_-panel-3" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">How accurate are heart rate and HRV?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_5a6_-panel-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_5a6_-button-3" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">In validation against chest-strap ECG, PACE Band measured heart rate within 1.8 bpm on average across 40 activity types and tracked overnight HRV with a 0.97 correlation. Accuracy can vary with fit, so wear the core snug, one finger above the wrist bone.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_5a6_-button-4" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_5a6_-panel-4" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">Can I swim and shower with it?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_5a6_-panel-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_5a6_-button-4" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Yes. The band is rated 10 ATM and tracks pool and open-water swims, including distance, stroke rate and SWOLF. The woven strap dries in about 20 minutes.</p></div></div></li></ul></div></div></section>
